WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 26

01:40.120 --> 01:42.480
SHEN'S MANSION

01:54.320 --> 01:57.680
The late aunt arranged this with my lady.

01:57.760 --> 02:00.440
A son from one family,
a daughter from another.

02:00.520 --> 02:02.760
Promised to be in-laws, bound forever.

02:02.840 --> 02:05.920
Back then, she was just past a year old.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.720
Fearing gossip, it wasn't widely known.

02:09.360 --> 02:11.400
Six years ago, her mother passed away.

02:11.480 --> 02:14.040
She went with her father to Hangzhou.

02:14.120 --> 02:16.120
Three years later, her father also died.

02:17.040 --> 02:18.960
The mourning delayed things for a while.

02:19.040 --> 02:21.320
Distance made communication hard.

02:21.400 --> 02:25.720
Plus, your family is noble and loyal.

02:25.800 --> 02:29.320
Her stepmother was mean and cold-hearted.

02:29.400 --> 02:31.440
So, they didn't send someone
to ask until now.

02:34.640 --> 02:37.720
This is her handwritten letter, no doubt.

02:39.760 --> 02:42.080
This pendant, a symbol of fortune

02:42.840 --> 02:44.360
with holes on the fins.

02:47.080 --> 02:50.080
She always wore it.

02:50.720 --> 02:54.360
It's a jade heirloom of the Shen family.

02:55.000 --> 02:59.160
When she was buried, we couldn't find it.

02:59.240 --> 03:01.680
This family jade

03:01.760 --> 03:04.400
is for Master Shen's future wife.

03:05.640 --> 03:06.840
Cui,

03:07.600 --> 03:09.960
this is for the old lady to decide.

03:10.040 --> 03:11.840
How dare you meddle?

03:11.920 --> 03:13.280
Sure.

03:13.920 --> 03:15.120
Such an important matter,

03:15.880 --> 03:18.560
I was kept in the dark.

03:18.640 --> 03:21.120
She was foolish to hide this from me.

03:21.720 --> 03:26.400
Maybe she thought I was sickly as a child.

03:26.480 --> 03:27.560
Never survive this old.

03:28.160 --> 03:31.600
Distance and time broke the connection,

03:31.680 --> 03:34.640
and the marriage was delayed.

03:35.880 --> 03:37.720
Don't blame me for speaking my mind.

03:37.800 --> 03:41.840
The old lady seems hesitant.
What's the matter?

03:42.560 --> 03:43.640
Naturally, she is.

03:43.720 --> 03:45.600
Master Shen already has a wife.

03:58.720 --> 04:00.240
Thanks for returning the pendant.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.760
Now, it's back where it belongs.

04:09.800 --> 04:10.920
My lady.

04:13.440 --> 04:14.560
My lady.

04:18.280 --> 04:22.880
Haode, how dare you be rude to a guest?

04:23.480 --> 04:25.240
You're out of line.

04:33.440 --> 04:34.320
Granny.

04:35.200 --> 04:39.280
She lost her parents.

04:39.360 --> 04:43.520
She has no one
and came here out of desperation.

04:44.160 --> 04:47.560
Maybe take her as a concubine at most.

04:48.200 --> 04:51.160
You are Huizhao's wife.

04:51.240 --> 04:56.400
I'm always on your side, you know that.

04:57.800 --> 05:00.640
No need to make things so awkward.

05:00.720 --> 05:02.160
You've lost all decorum.

05:02.800 --> 05:06.720
When my brother-in-law proposed,
Kangning had only one condition.

05:07.800 --> 05:09.520
Anyone marrying a Li family daughter

05:09.600 --> 05:13.240
must take one wife only. No concubines.

05:13.840 --> 05:16.520
How dare you say such a thing.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.920
If word gets out,

05:18.440 --> 05:22.720
they'll call you jealous and improper.

05:22.800 --> 05:26.400
This will make it hard

05:27.320 --> 05:29.040
for your sister to marry.

05:29.920 --> 05:30.920
Granny.

05:32.000 --> 05:35.520
I come from a humble background,
not a noble one.

05:36.520 --> 05:37.720
But I stand firm on it.

05:37.800 --> 05:41.280
No matter how much education I have,
I can't change my heart.

05:42.200 --> 05:46.120
What woman would
share her husband willingly?

05:46.200 --> 05:47.720
Even you, Granny,

05:47.800 --> 05:50.560
doesn't it pain you
to see three concubines?

05:54.920 --> 05:58.680
I will never allow a concubine
and back down.

05:59.440 --> 06:00.880
If I give in,

06:00.960 --> 06:04.360
it'll set a bad example
for my brothers-in-law.

06:04.440 --> 06:06.320
The Li family's rules will be broken.

06:06.400 --> 06:09.280
I'd disgrace my sisters and myself.

06:10.080 --> 06:13.200
Granny, punish me as you wish,

06:13.720 --> 06:15.880
- but I won't compromise.
- You…

06:23.080 --> 06:26.360
My lady,
it's not that the old lady is heartless.

06:26.440 --> 06:29.320
That young lady was betrothed as a child.

06:29.400 --> 06:30.640
Her parents are gone.

06:30.720 --> 06:34.800
If we don't accept her,
the Shen family will be seen

06:34.880 --> 06:36.000
as dishonorable.

06:36.080 --> 06:37.680
Calling her a concubine

06:37.760 --> 06:40.200
is already a compromise.

06:40.800 --> 06:42.720
How can you not understand?

07:09.880 --> 07:11.280
Enough.

07:12.160 --> 07:14.760
I won't deal with this anymore.

08:08.840 --> 08:09.760
Qingshi. Qingshi.

08:14.520 --> 08:15.360
My lord.

08:15.440 --> 08:16.720
From now on,

08:16.800 --> 08:19.720
without my orders,
no one is allowed into this study.

08:22.680 --> 08:23.680
Didn't you hear me?

08:24.280 --> 08:25.120
Yes.

08:27.040 --> 08:28.400
My lady, this…

08:29.200 --> 08:31.880
These are documents for official matters.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.160
Criminal cases go to the left.

08:34.240 --> 08:36.080
Population and taxes are on the right.

08:36.600 --> 08:38.520
Local customs go in the middle.

08:38.600 --> 08:41.480
Errors from both courts are in that pile.

08:41.560 --> 08:44.280
He marked for resubmission
after corrections.

08:46.560 --> 08:47.600
Sure.

08:47.680 --> 08:50.520
My lord, you seem fine now,

08:50.600 --> 08:51.600
not confused.

08:52.200 --> 08:53.080
But the physician said

08:53.160 --> 08:56.880
you still get headaches and nausea.

08:56.960 --> 09:00.360
Your internal injuries are serious.
If you keep pushing,

09:00.960 --> 09:03.760
you could faint, at best,
or lose your life, at worst.

09:04.880 --> 09:08.120
If I can't read the files,
have someone else handle them.

09:08.200 --> 09:11.120
If you refuse, I'll tell the old lady.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.400
I won't cover for you.

09:14.000 --> 09:17.480
- You…
- Qingshi, can you even handle this?

09:18.760 --> 09:21.200
I can read, but I can't process cases.

09:21.280 --> 09:22.840
Plus, these are urgent matters.

09:23.480 --> 09:24.760
They're not for servants.

09:24.840 --> 09:26.920
There are capable officials at Yamen.

09:27.440 --> 09:30.520
Judge Yuan, Clerk Wang, Magistrate Liu.

09:30.600 --> 09:33.240
All of them are skilled and knowledgeable.

09:33.320 --> 09:36.000
So, who would you like to assist you?

09:36.080 --> 09:39.760
These documents aren't for outsiders.
That'll ruin everything.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.520
Shut up. Get out.

09:42.080 --> 09:43.120
Sure.

09:47.720 --> 09:51.480
I don't remember a thing
about us recently.

09:51.560 --> 09:54.400
Whatever you do, it's all pointless.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.440
The Shen family won't keep you.

09:59.160 --> 10:00.200
You…

10:22.720 --> 10:26.480
Where is the imperial land dispute case?

10:40.160 --> 10:43.600
You said it needs imperial approval,
so I placed it here.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.720
If you're free,

10:46.800 --> 10:49.000
why not review the Deng case with me?

10:49.080 --> 10:50.200
I said I remember already.

10:50.280 --> 10:53.640
You remember the past,
but forgot what came after.

10:54.440 --> 10:58.440
How do you recall the cases,
but forget your wife?

11:20.320 --> 11:22.520
He was feverish just yesterday.

11:22.600 --> 11:24.960
He just got better today
and he's already back working.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.600
The old lady is worried.

11:27.680 --> 11:30.080
She almost called a physician
to the court to check on him.

11:30.160 --> 11:32.760
I had to persuade her
to let go of the idea.

11:32.840 --> 11:34.040
She only let me bring medicine.

11:39.600 --> 11:40.480
Where is he?

11:41.400 --> 11:43.800
My lady, he's handling the Deng case now.

11:43.880 --> 11:45.960
The woman was buried alive,

11:46.040 --> 11:47.960
clearly murdered by them. Why bother?

11:48.040 --> 11:50.720
My lady, you don't know.
She committed adultery.

11:50.800 --> 11:52.520
Her lover is confessing in court.

11:53.840 --> 11:54.720
What?

11:56.440 --> 11:58.240
I was just a laborer for the Dengs.

11:58.960 --> 12:03.040
His wife often sent maids
to fetch water and stoke fires.

12:03.120 --> 12:05.280
One time, Ah Tao fell ill.

12:05.360 --> 12:07.560
The lady fetched her own water.

12:08.320 --> 12:10.720
I pitied her and helped her often.

12:10.800 --> 12:12.040
Over time,

12:13.360 --> 12:14.280
she got pregnant by me.

12:14.360 --> 12:16.520
Her in-laws accidentally found out.

12:16.600 --> 12:17.960
She plotted with me in secret

12:18.640 --> 12:20.080
to fake her death in childbirth.

12:20.160 --> 12:22.120
We waited for the Dengs to bury her.

12:22.640 --> 12:25.040
At midnight, I planned to dig her out.

12:25.720 --> 12:28.320
Then we'd elope to her uncle in Jiangning.

12:28.920 --> 12:31.840
I drank for courage that night
but arrived late.

12:31.920 --> 12:35.400
I saw mourners at another grave
and didn't dare approach.

12:36.280 --> 12:38.800
Almost at dawn, I opened the coffin.

12:39.360 --> 12:43.320
Sadly, the air hole we left
had been blocked by soil.

12:43.400 --> 12:45.760
She had already suffocated.

12:46.400 --> 12:48.440
Master, I didn't report it earlier

12:48.520 --> 12:50.920
to avoid disgrace for my family.

12:52.000 --> 12:54.880
Now, there's no hiding it anymore.

12:55.480 --> 12:58.360
She secretly conceived with another man.

12:58.440 --> 13:00.240
She begged me to help her escape.

13:00.320 --> 13:03.240
I thought, two lives were at stake,

13:03.320 --> 13:05.000
so I let her go.

13:05.080 --> 13:07.040
I thought of her as dead.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.600
It'd be better than causing grief.

13:08.680 --> 13:11.960
But this fool ruined everything
while drunk.

13:12.040 --> 13:14.240
He caused this entire disaster.

13:14.320 --> 13:16.240
She died by her own doing.

13:16.320 --> 13:18.760
It has nothing to do with my family.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.840
I'm the one who should file a complaint.

13:20.920 --> 13:22.080
They slandered us.

13:22.160 --> 13:23.400
They raised a daughter

13:24.440 --> 13:25.440
who ruined us.

13:29.360 --> 13:32.080
You all have no shame!

13:32.160 --> 13:33.840
No shame at all.

13:34.680 --> 13:37.960
Mother, why did you hide this from me?

13:38.040 --> 13:38.960
Nonsense!

13:39.960 --> 13:43.360
You tormented your wife daily.
Everyone knows.

13:43.440 --> 13:46.200
She never dared to spend your money.

13:46.280 --> 13:47.640
It was all from her dowry.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.560
Last month, she was about to give birth.

13:49.640 --> 13:51.680
Suddenly, you were kind to her.

13:51.760 --> 13:53.680
You even sent me to fetch a midwife.

13:53.760 --> 13:55.960
The midwife had just stepped in

13:56.040 --> 13:58.200
when she screamed and died.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.520
You must've planned to kill her!

14:02.480 --> 14:04.440
You killed her.

14:04.520 --> 14:06.520
Now you slander her for adultery?

14:08.240 --> 14:09.160
My lord,

14:09.800 --> 14:12.840
they bully my daughter who can't speak!

14:12.920 --> 14:13.760
Lies!

14:14.560 --> 14:18.200
Yaoniu, even if Mrs. Deng helped,

14:18.280 --> 14:19.720
how did you fool everyone else?

14:19.800 --> 14:22.160
I got a prescription from a physician

14:23.600 --> 14:27.920
to fake death for three days. Here it is.

14:28.520 --> 14:32.120
You claim you had an affair with Ji,
but what proof do you have?

14:33.000 --> 14:34.080
Her undergarments,

14:34.160 --> 14:36.360
along with a love poem.

14:36.440 --> 14:38.000
I folded it into a charm

14:38.080 --> 14:39.440
and kept it.

14:39.520 --> 14:40.600
Ridiculous!

14:42.200 --> 14:45.520
If you had an affair with her,
why defend the Deng family?

14:45.600 --> 14:48.560
Aren't you afraid I'll charge you first?

14:48.640 --> 14:51.280
An affair gets a beating at most,

14:52.000 --> 14:53.760
but murder means death.

14:53.840 --> 14:57.320
I had no grudge against Deng.

14:57.400 --> 14:59.280
How could I let him die unjustly?

14:59.360 --> 15:02.840
This proves I'm an honest man.

15:02.920 --> 15:05.160
Please judge me leniently.

15:05.240 --> 15:07.720
My Lord, the adulterer confessed.

15:08.440 --> 15:10.000
You must bring justice for my son!

15:12.240 --> 15:13.160
Never.

15:18.160 --> 15:21.440
My lord, Yaoniu confessed at the court.

15:21.520 --> 15:25.040
Word spread, accusing Ji of infidelity.

15:25.120 --> 15:28.800
They say Ji framed Deng,
and Deng's riling up the clan.

15:28.880 --> 15:32.480
They crowd the court daily,
demanding release.

15:32.560 --> 15:35.080
A lover appeared out of nowhere.

15:35.160 --> 15:38.440
They conspired to incite chaos with kin.

15:39.880 --> 15:42.520
He claimed he had a fake death potion.

15:42.600 --> 15:44.360
Bring someone to replicate the potion now.

15:44.440 --> 15:46.600
He must take it himself.

15:46.680 --> 15:50.160
If it doesn't work,
I'll have him beaten to death.

15:50.960 --> 15:52.200
- Sure.
- My lord.

15:56.000 --> 15:58.120
The same potion has a different effect.

15:58.200 --> 16:00.800
Some died from it, others recovered.

16:00.880 --> 16:04.320
Ji Rou's frailty made her unconscious.

16:04.400 --> 16:05.760
It might not work for him.

16:06.680 --> 16:09.120
What if he denies whatever?

16:09.200 --> 16:11.920
What are you going to do?

16:14.800 --> 16:17.720
My lord, why would Yaoniu confess

16:17.800 --> 16:18.880
his adultery?

16:20.320 --> 16:22.880
Clearly, someone paid him to do it.

16:26.440 --> 16:29.360
Adultery with a married woman
gets 20 lashes.

16:30.560 --> 16:33.560
He must've been bribed
to endure such little pain.

16:33.640 --> 16:34.760
That's obvious.

16:37.080 --> 16:37.960
What's your point?

16:40.240 --> 16:43.000
Adultery is minor. Murder is severe.

16:44.040 --> 16:46.240
He claims he was the servant
of the Deng family.

16:46.320 --> 16:48.800
If it was him killing his master?

16:49.360 --> 16:50.880
What crimes does he commit?

16:50.960 --> 16:52.840
But he didn't kill anyone.

16:58.360 --> 16:59.280
What do you think?

17:06.600 --> 17:07.600
Let's test it.

17:15.040 --> 17:15.880
Bring her in.

17:15.960 --> 17:16.840
KAIFENG COURT

17:19.800 --> 17:22.800
Yaoniu, you spoke

17:22.880 --> 17:25.720
of a fake death potion,
which was taken by Ji.

17:25.800 --> 17:27.840
Yes, my lord. It's true.

17:27.920 --> 17:29.080
Very well, then.

17:30.080 --> 17:30.960
Coroner.

17:31.040 --> 17:33.320
My lord, I've examined the body

17:33.400 --> 17:35.240
and cleaned it with alcohol.

17:35.320 --> 17:37.320
The body shows purplish swelling.

17:37.400 --> 17:40.600
There are bruises
from struggling in the coffin,

17:40.680 --> 17:42.920
but no other external injuries.

17:43.000 --> 17:46.000
I must also check her mouth and throat.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.920
The poison is confirmed.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.800
Coroner,

18:07.880 --> 18:11.080
wasn't Ji asphyxiated in the coffin?

18:11.160 --> 18:14.000
My lord,
she was poisoned with arsenic first.

18:14.080 --> 18:16.520
The dose wasn't lethal, so she didn't die.

18:16.600 --> 18:19.240
But after waking up in the coffin,
she struggled to get out.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.120
She later suffocated.

18:21.720 --> 18:25.520
Yaoniu, you plotted
to murder your mistress.

18:25.600 --> 18:27.680
This needle proves your crime.

18:27.760 --> 18:30.360
If I don't use force, you won't admit it.

18:30.440 --> 18:32.240
Eighty strokes. Do it.

18:32.320 --> 18:35.640
My lord, it was fake death medicine,
not poison.

18:35.720 --> 18:36.920
I'm innocent!

18:37.960 --> 18:39.800
My lord.

18:45.720 --> 18:46.760
My lord!

18:50.440 --> 18:52.240
Since you confessed,

18:52.880 --> 18:55.120
I'll execute you now.

18:55.200 --> 18:57.720
Others would agree on this judge too.

18:57.800 --> 19:01.400
My lord, I didn't poison anyone.

19:01.480 --> 19:02.840
It's true!

19:02.920 --> 19:05.720
Didn't you say you had an affair with her?

19:05.800 --> 19:07.280
No, I didn't! No affair!

19:07.360 --> 19:09.640
My lord, it's Mrs. Deng!

19:09.720 --> 19:10.840
She bribed me to lie

19:10.920 --> 19:13.680
and frame her daughter-in-law.

19:13.760 --> 19:15.800
Silence, you wretch!

19:16.400 --> 19:18.840
Enduring torture
doesn't excuse framing others.

19:18.920 --> 19:20.680
You deserve to die for such deceit.

19:20.760 --> 19:23.840
The Deng family is a big name.

19:24.600 --> 19:28.320
Why would they ruin their own reputation?

19:28.400 --> 19:31.880
You must've tried to drag them down.

19:32.680 --> 19:33.520
Keep going.

19:34.120 --> 19:34.960
My lord!

19:35.560 --> 19:38.400
The bribe is hidden in my yard,
within a pickle jar.

19:38.480 --> 19:42.200
Check under the big tree behind my house.

19:43.000 --> 19:45.960
She promised only 20 lashes
but blamed the crime on me.

19:46.560 --> 19:49.440
The Deng family will die out for this!

19:49.520 --> 19:51.640
How dare you curse us, villain!

19:52.920 --> 19:53.800
Mom.

19:55.040 --> 19:55.880
Stop.

19:58.080 --> 20:01.400
My lord, it's all the Deng family's doing.

20:01.480 --> 20:04.960
I was taking the fall for them.

20:05.040 --> 20:08.480
I'll have the bribe investigated.

20:08.560 --> 20:12.080
Ah Tao, describe that night in detail.

20:12.160 --> 20:13.360
Sure.

20:13.920 --> 20:16.640
That night, the mistress went into labor.

20:16.720 --> 20:20.760
I fetched the midwife
while Master Deng waited outside the room.

20:21.280 --> 20:24.520
Servants scrambled,
preparing cloth and scissors.

20:24.600 --> 20:27.160
- Then a scream came from her room.
- What took you so long?

20:29.160 --> 20:31.880
What woman doesn't cry out
during childbirth?

20:31.960 --> 20:33.760
Don't twist the story to blame us.

20:34.360 --> 20:37.240
My daughter-in-law's care
relied on the maid.

20:37.840 --> 20:40.520
If she ate something poisonous,

20:40.600 --> 20:41.800
it wasn't our doing.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.720
If it was her maid killing her,

20:44.600 --> 20:47.240
why would you bribe Yaoniu
to take the blame?

20:47.320 --> 20:49.680
Still lying? The truth is uncovering.

20:53.520 --> 20:55.520
My lord, I remember something.

20:55.600 --> 20:58.320
Before childbirth,
my lady said she was hungry.

20:58.400 --> 21:01.600
I made rice soup,
but it was delivered by Master Deng.

21:02.360 --> 21:04.480
My lord, I did deliver the soup,

21:04.560 --> 21:06.000
but I didn't poison her.

21:06.080 --> 21:10.000
Ji was near labor,
and the maid stayed close.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.360
Where could she buy arsenic?

21:11.960 --> 21:15.880
If she killed her, why report it publicly?

21:15.960 --> 21:19.280
Ji's death ties back to the Deng family.

21:19.360 --> 21:22.880
If you, the son, poisoned her,
your mother covered it up.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.240
That makes sense.

21:24.320 --> 21:25.480
Guards!

21:26.160 --> 21:28.720
The Deng family bribed someone
to fake witnesses.

21:29.280 --> 21:30.680
There must be a reason.

21:31.440 --> 21:33.680
Drag Deng Jingfu away. Beat him. Now!

21:33.760 --> 21:36.440
- My lord, I did not poison her!
- We are wronged!

21:37.160 --> 21:38.560
- I am wronged!
- We didn't do it!

21:38.640 --> 21:39.680
My son's wronged!

21:39.760 --> 21:40.960
I'm innocent, my lord!

21:41.680 --> 21:42.840
My lord.

21:42.920 --> 21:43.920
My lord.

21:44.440 --> 21:45.560
I didn't do that!

21:45.640 --> 21:46.640
My lord.

21:46.720 --> 21:49.840
My lord, I didn't kill her.

21:49.920 --> 21:51.680
- Don't beat him!
- My lord!

21:53.040 --> 21:55.360
- My lord!
- Don't beat him!

21:56.040 --> 21:59.400
My son's taking the exam.
What if he's crippled?

22:00.240 --> 22:03.760
It's me! I did it!

22:03.840 --> 22:06.280
All of it was my doing.

22:07.120 --> 22:10.680
How did you kill your daughter-in-law?
Speak now.

22:11.440 --> 22:12.920
My lord.

22:14.280 --> 22:16.680
I have no idea
where the arsenic came from.

22:16.760 --> 22:19.200
I did send everyone out.

22:20.360 --> 22:21.600
While she was in labor,

22:22.280 --> 22:24.480
I used a three-inch needle

22:24.560 --> 22:26.280
and pierced her crown.

22:27.200 --> 22:29.120
Who knew she didn't die?

22:29.200 --> 22:31.920
How could she survive in the coffin?

22:33.120 --> 22:36.280
Give me back my daughter!

22:36.880 --> 22:40.040
Mom, she was with a child.

22:41.240 --> 22:43.000
How could you do that?

22:45.280 --> 22:46.520
Son.

22:48.080 --> 22:50.200
It was all for you.

22:50.280 --> 22:53.800
You married beneath you.
How will you ever rise?

22:54.400 --> 22:57.240
If she didn't die, how could I help you

22:57.320 --> 22:59.200
marry into a noble family?

22:59.960 --> 23:03.840
It was all for your sake!

23:03.920 --> 23:06.920
The arsenic?
I swear I knew nothing about it.

23:07.000 --> 23:08.840
I swear.

23:09.520 --> 23:12.920
The arsenic only touched the cloth
he used to clean the needle.

23:13.520 --> 23:14.880
If I hadn't claimed so,

23:14.960 --> 23:16.960
how would Yaoniu confess?

23:17.800 --> 23:20.720
How else could I prove
you bribed him to take the blame?

23:21.680 --> 23:23.920
My lord! Please, my lord!

23:24.960 --> 23:26.120
She's my mother, my elder!

23:27.080 --> 23:29.600
She was confused, a senior acting rashly.

23:30.440 --> 23:32.760
Can't you lighten her sentence?

23:32.840 --> 23:34.640
Show her some mercy? My lord.

23:34.720 --> 23:37.560
Please, my lord!

23:37.640 --> 23:38.760
Silence!

23:39.520 --> 23:41.240
You, not guiding your mother,

23:41.320 --> 23:43.560
nor protecting your wife,

23:43.640 --> 23:45.800
led to this heinous crime
against humanity.

23:46.360 --> 23:49.040
You failed as a son,
a husband, and a father.

23:49.560 --> 23:50.640
Eighty strokes for you.

23:51.320 --> 23:54.200
Mrs. Deng craved wealth,
killing her daughter-in-law.

23:54.280 --> 23:56.560
She even murdered her grandson.
Such an inhuman crime.

23:56.640 --> 24:00.320
Two lives were lost by her hands,
then she tried to shift the blame.

24:00.400 --> 24:03.120
Her crime is too great
for leniency or exceptions.

24:03.680 --> 24:06.680
I'll petition His Majesty
for her execution by slicing.

24:06.760 --> 24:08.560
It'll serve as a warning for others.

24:09.520 --> 24:10.640
My lord!

24:11.680 --> 24:15.280
Mom! Mom! Mom!

24:16.800 --> 24:17.760
Mom.

24:37.080 --> 24:38.240
My lady.

24:38.320 --> 24:40.160
Don't lose heart.
You can't go on like this.

24:40.960 --> 24:43.360
That Li Haode, a mere tea seller by birth.

24:43.440 --> 24:45.320
She's cunning and calculating.

24:45.920 --> 24:49.080
She went to the court

24:49.840 --> 24:52.600
to serve tea and medicine,
flattering and scheming.

24:52.680 --> 24:56.720
She took your place as wife
and denied you a home.

24:56.800 --> 24:58.440
You must act now to secure your future.

24:58.520 --> 25:00.800
The Shen family broke the promise…

25:03.680 --> 25:05.600
and even took my keepsake.

25:06.920 --> 25:08.520
I'm alone, helpless,

25:10.160 --> 25:11.840
with no family to stand for me.

25:12.680 --> 25:13.920
What can I possibly do?

25:14.680 --> 25:15.560
Don't despair.

25:16.400 --> 25:19.600
You've mastered every art since childhood.

25:20.320 --> 25:22.680
Your father cherished you,
treated you like a treasure.

25:22.760 --> 25:24.760
How could you end up
with such a cruel stepmother

25:24.840 --> 25:27.320
who sold you off for a bride price?

25:28.320 --> 25:30.680
We traveled far and endured much.

25:30.760 --> 25:32.680
Now, we finally arrived at the Shen's.

25:32.760 --> 25:34.240
We can't let it go.

25:36.760 --> 25:40.680
Cui, tell me. What should I do?

25:50.400 --> 25:51.600
No, no, no.

25:52.320 --> 25:54.800
I can't do such shameful things.

25:55.720 --> 25:56.880
I won't.

25:58.480 --> 25:59.760
I can't.

25:59.840 --> 26:04.480
My lady, this is no time for modesty.

26:04.560 --> 26:07.400
Do you want to go back and suffer again?

26:10.440 --> 26:11.560
I don't.

26:12.760 --> 26:13.840
I won't.

26:17.760 --> 26:20.800
My lord, Fang's servant Cui is here.

26:20.880 --> 26:23.080
She says it's urgent
and needs to speak with you.

26:23.160 --> 26:24.360
Please meet her.

26:30.040 --> 26:31.240
Has she come yet?

26:34.120 --> 26:36.400
The lady hasn't brought the medicine yet.

26:37.000 --> 26:40.600
If she comes, leave it,
but don't let her in.

26:40.680 --> 26:41.760
Yes.

26:54.480 --> 26:56.880
My lord's busy with work
and can't make it now.

26:57.480 --> 27:00.120
Please let me apologize on his behalf.
He won't come.

27:00.200 --> 27:02.320
Don't do this. She's waiting for him.

27:02.400 --> 27:04.880
Please inform him again.

27:04.960 --> 27:08.600
Say it's about his uncle's
last words and belongings.

27:08.680 --> 27:10.480
The lady must hand them
to the lord herself.

27:11.400 --> 27:12.440
Please make it happen.

27:12.520 --> 27:13.560
I wouldn't dare.

27:13.640 --> 27:14.800
No, I couldn't.

27:14.880 --> 27:15.920
Please don't do this.

27:16.000 --> 27:18.360
Well, I'll try again.

27:19.680 --> 27:20.760
Thank you.

27:36.640 --> 27:39.200
Haode, listen to me.

27:44.160 --> 27:48.040
Even if she's fallen,
she's still from a noble family.

27:48.120 --> 27:49.680
How could she stoop to such disgrace?

27:50.920 --> 27:52.040
I don't believe it.

27:52.120 --> 27:54.680
You told me to ask,
so I'm just reporting back.

27:54.760 --> 27:56.200
You'll see the truth soon enough.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.600
Yan'er, Xi'er.

28:09.520 --> 28:10.920
Go to the storeroom.

28:11.000 --> 28:12.240
What do you need?

28:18.880 --> 28:20.160
Just go.

28:21.520 --> 28:22.680
Bring Qingshi here

28:22.760 --> 28:25.360
and say the old lady wants to ask
about the lord's meal today.

28:25.440 --> 28:26.440
Nothing else.

28:27.120 --> 28:28.000
Sure.

28:42.560 --> 28:44.600
The old lady requests
to speak with my lord.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.920
The lord will pass by in no time.

28:47.520 --> 28:49.120
Where's the item she tried to pass on?

28:50.520 --> 28:51.720
She said

28:51.800 --> 28:55.160
her late father entrusted it to her care.

28:55.240 --> 28:58.720
It must be handed over
in person to fulfill her duty.

28:58.800 --> 28:59.920
Of course.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.320
You said

29:01.400 --> 29:03.760
the lord would pass by soon.

29:03.840 --> 29:05.000
Yes.

29:06.160 --> 29:07.920
Then I'll go ahead and inform her.

29:14.360 --> 29:15.600
Don't be shy, my lady.

29:15.680 --> 29:18.480
If he steps through the door,
you've already won.

29:18.560 --> 29:21.440
Just cry prettily and tell your story.

29:21.520 --> 29:22.760
He won't ignore.

29:28.080 --> 29:29.640
Where's Rui'er?

29:29.720 --> 29:32.080
She still hasn't brought the hot water.

29:39.040 --> 29:40.520
Where were you? I--

29:41.120 --> 29:43.560
You dress so little.
It's too cold outside.

29:43.640 --> 29:45.040
Wrap her up.

29:50.880 --> 29:51.760
That's okay.

29:52.400 --> 29:54.680
Your silk pick is gorgeous.

29:59.360 --> 30:01.840
My lord, Lady Fang insists you meet her.

30:01.920 --> 30:04.120
The lady says she'll go in your place.

30:04.840 --> 30:06.040
Nonsense.

30:20.160 --> 30:23.160
You're here. Then… who's inside?

30:34.040 --> 30:36.760
My lord, cousin arrived in a rush.

30:36.840 --> 30:38.680
I feared she lacked supplies.

30:39.280 --> 30:42.200
So, I picked fine silks
and jewelry for her.

30:42.280 --> 30:44.280
I sent them overnight.

30:44.960 --> 30:47.880
Do you care about her too?
So, that's why you're here?

30:47.960 --> 30:49.360
Have you delivered?

30:50.240 --> 30:51.920
- Yes.
- Then why haven't you left?

31:04.120 --> 31:07.040
Cui, as her wet nurse,

31:07.120 --> 31:09.880
you must guide her.

31:09.960 --> 31:12.320
She's young and naive,
unaware of the stakes.

31:12.400 --> 31:17.160
Her father trusted you to care of her.

31:17.240 --> 31:18.720
Is this how you advise her?

31:19.320 --> 31:21.120
A good daughter

31:22.160 --> 31:23.600
would never take such a path.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.920
My lord, I'd never dare.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.320
Cousin.

31:30.200 --> 31:34.720
Cousin, Cui may be foolish,
but she means well.

31:34.800 --> 31:38.560
Please, for my sake,
forgive her this time.

31:52.040 --> 31:54.640
Cousin, I traveled far seeking refuge.

31:55.960 --> 31:57.320
I don't want to cause trouble.

31:58.800 --> 32:01.080
My stepmother pushed me to the edge.

32:01.720 --> 32:03.040
I have no choice.

32:04.040 --> 32:06.000
Please tell the old lady
I mean no offense.

32:06.600 --> 32:08.240
I know I'm plain

32:08.800 --> 32:10.040
and unworthy.

32:11.240 --> 32:12.480
Never dream beyond my range.

32:13.200 --> 32:15.360
If you find me unfit,

32:16.000 --> 32:19.800
I'll clean the courtyard
to make it up to you.

32:20.800 --> 32:22.000
Just don't send me away.

32:22.840 --> 32:24.040
Cousin,

32:25.080 --> 32:26.200
don't send me away.

32:26.280 --> 32:28.480
I beg you, don't cast me out.

32:31.160 --> 32:32.200
So,

32:33.640 --> 32:35.440
you want to stay as a concubine?

32:41.120 --> 32:45.520
Serving you for life would be my fortune.

32:46.400 --> 32:49.920
But I fear I'd offend your wife.

32:50.000 --> 32:52.200
I wouldn't dare cause you trouble.

32:53.480 --> 32:57.000
If that's the case,
find me a place at a temple

32:57.080 --> 32:58.400
to live out my days.

32:59.000 --> 33:01.480
I'd rather shave my head and be a nun

33:01.560 --> 33:04.080
than fall to ruin

33:04.640 --> 33:06.000
and dishonor my family's name.

33:09.120 --> 33:12.600
When you passed the garden,
did you see an old well?

33:12.680 --> 33:15.360
The one sealed in the southeast corner?

33:18.800 --> 33:20.840
- I--
- My enemies are endless.

33:21.440 --> 33:24.040
I can't kill them all.

33:24.120 --> 33:27.360
My sister Yingying was six that year.

33:27.440 --> 33:30.760
Bandits held her hostage
to make me surrender.

33:30.840 --> 33:32.240
But I didn't.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.080
She died

33:34.840 --> 33:36.360
in my arms.

33:37.760 --> 33:38.600
After that,

33:39.560 --> 33:42.320
my mother fell ill and mad.

33:42.400 --> 33:44.240
One night, a year later,

33:44.840 --> 33:46.120
she disappeared.

33:47.200 --> 33:48.480
We found her shoes

33:49.400 --> 33:51.160
by that well.

33:54.680 --> 33:55.760
Aunt…

33:57.080 --> 33:58.680
So, that's how she died.

34:00.320 --> 34:02.440
Before Haode married into the Shen family,

34:03.040 --> 34:04.840
she was just a teahouse owner's daughter.

34:05.720 --> 34:07.400
She was carefree

34:08.240 --> 34:09.680
and lived a simple life.

34:10.440 --> 34:13.520
The day before you arrived,
she almost died.

34:13.600 --> 34:15.040
A gang of bandits nearly killed her.

34:15.120 --> 34:18.360
She was terrified but stayed strong.

34:19.200 --> 34:21.800
She saved Granny from the slaughter.

34:23.480 --> 34:24.920
Once you join the Shen family,

34:25.600 --> 34:29.320
uncertainties like death
await you in the future.

34:29.400 --> 34:31.360
Will your life end in bloodshed
or in that well?

34:32.120 --> 34:35.320
My wife lives like this is the last day
in the world.

34:36.880 --> 34:39.120
There is no room to care for a concubine.

34:40.200 --> 34:41.760
No one cares if she lives or dies.

34:44.000 --> 34:47.800
Cousin, you're joking, right?

34:47.880 --> 34:48.880
What?

34:50.920 --> 34:52.000
Do you want to try?

34:53.280 --> 34:54.160
Good.

34:54.240 --> 34:56.840
The dowry my mother brought
from your family Fang,

34:56.920 --> 34:58.360
I will give half of it to you.

34:58.440 --> 35:01.560
With it, you will marry well.

35:03.840 --> 35:05.840
Don't listen to that foolish servant.

35:05.920 --> 35:08.720
She'll ruin your life. Remember that.

35:09.680 --> 35:13.120
You're guests here.
You shouldn't bother the hostess.

35:13.760 --> 35:17.320
Anyone who forgets their manners
will be punished.

35:17.400 --> 35:20.760
Don't blame me for not showing mercy.

35:21.640 --> 35:23.160
I'll send you back home tomorrow.

35:26.640 --> 35:27.560
Cui,

35:28.520 --> 35:31.120
you're old and confused,
and it's your first time.

35:31.920 --> 35:35.000
I'll give you ten lashes
on behalf of her dad.

35:36.080 --> 35:37.280
No more mistakes.

35:37.360 --> 35:39.680
There won't be a next time.

35:41.880 --> 35:46.000
STEADFAST AND CONSIDERATE PATH

35:55.400 --> 35:58.080
My lady.

36:00.800 --> 36:03.760
SHEN'S MANSION

36:12.400 --> 36:13.560
What's going on?

36:14.560 --> 36:18.040
The Lord says he is busy in the office
and need to stay out for a while.

36:24.920 --> 36:25.960
No need.

36:26.760 --> 36:28.920
Tell him this is the Shen's mansion.

36:29.000 --> 36:31.640
If anyone should avoid,
it should be me, the outsider.

36:31.720 --> 36:32.920
Tell him not to worry.

36:33.000 --> 36:34.560
I won't bother him again.

36:36.280 --> 36:37.600
I want to divorce my husband.

36:45.080 --> 36:47.200
My lord, will we still move?

36:49.160 --> 36:50.360
Put it back.

36:51.920 --> 36:53.960
What are you waiting for? Put it back.

37:00.720 --> 37:02.120
HOUSEHOLD AND MARRIAGE DEPARTMENT

37:26.360 --> 37:29.160
His Majesty sent Mr. Du here for training.

37:29.240 --> 37:32.600
You'll serve for a year or more
before receiving a higher position,

37:32.680 --> 37:35.440
but you need to focus on the case.

37:35.520 --> 37:39.400
If there are any mistakes,
I won't show leniency.

37:39.480 --> 37:41.000
My lord,

37:41.640 --> 37:43.960
has anything gone wrong with the files?

37:46.200 --> 37:47.480
Not yet.

37:48.040 --> 37:48.880
Then it's fine.

37:52.480 --> 37:54.400
Though our ranks differ,

37:54.480 --> 37:57.200
we know each other,
and we are married to the Li sisters.

37:57.840 --> 37:59.240
Now that we're alone,

38:01.920 --> 38:03.760
we should talk like relatives.

38:04.680 --> 38:06.320
Why are you getting colder?

38:07.200 --> 38:10.920
No wonder you've been alone
without a single friend for years.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.640
Seems you've made many enemies instead.

38:13.680 --> 38:16.320
Why beat around the bush?
Just say it plainly.

38:16.960 --> 38:19.480
Haode left, saying she wants a divorce.

38:20.520 --> 38:22.680
This is the dowry list
she brought when she married.

38:23.520 --> 38:25.480
Please return it just as it is.

38:28.440 --> 38:29.320
Understood.

38:29.960 --> 38:32.280
- What did you say?
- I said, understood.

38:33.200 --> 38:34.280
Understood what?

38:34.360 --> 38:37.600
The Li family isn't a noble one,
but with me as her brother-in-law,

38:37.680 --> 38:40.440
it won't be hard for her
to find a good match.

38:40.520 --> 38:41.600
But she only wanted you.

38:42.200 --> 38:43.240
I don't understand.

38:43.320 --> 38:45.600
You are elder, cold-tempered,
and stubborn.

38:46.200 --> 38:49.120
After your marriage,
she's faced many troubles.

38:49.720 --> 38:51.120
She nearly lost her life.

38:51.720 --> 38:54.200
Why are you staring at me?
You're not divorced yet.

38:54.280 --> 38:56.600
I'm your brother-in-law.
What's wrong with saying this?

38:57.800 --> 39:00.200
All my fault for matchmaking
and causing trouble.

39:00.280 --> 39:02.360
Now my wife has kicked me out.

39:03.160 --> 39:05.000
My stuff's all at the door.

39:05.640 --> 39:08.680
What's wrong with me speaking?
What's wrong?

39:19.000 --> 39:22.640
Wealth is easy, but true love is rare.

39:22.720 --> 39:25.320
Where else is there a fool like her?

39:25.400 --> 39:26.400
Risked her life for you.

39:26.480 --> 39:29.080
Come home and apologize now.

39:29.160 --> 39:30.920
Let's pretend this never happened.
Come on.

39:35.680 --> 39:37.520
DOWRY LIST

39:39.200 --> 39:40.840
I'll have her dowry prepared.

39:40.920 --> 39:43.760
Documentations for estates, lands,
tenants, and shops,

39:44.440 --> 39:45.400
all will be sent back.

39:47.560 --> 39:50.160
What crime did she commit to deserve this?

39:50.240 --> 39:51.880
Others don't know, but you should.

39:52.520 --> 39:55.440
When you accused your father,
you faced death.

39:56.120 --> 39:57.400
What did you do?

39:57.480 --> 40:00.320
Cut ties with Shouhua.

40:01.080 --> 40:02.160
Why?

40:03.000 --> 40:05.000
Hope she will live
safely and peacefully after.

40:05.560 --> 40:07.920
She risked her life for me.
I owe her that much.

40:08.000 --> 40:10.480
If I don't stop now,
how is that love for her?

40:12.360 --> 40:15.680
Did you even ask her? Did you ask--

40:15.760 --> 40:17.360
Even if she agrees, I can't accept it.

40:20.800 --> 40:22.440
Do you know how my mother

40:23.400 --> 40:25.320
looked at me before she died?

40:26.920 --> 40:28.280
She blamed me for being cold

40:30.000 --> 40:33.000
and herself for failing Yingying.

40:34.160 --> 40:36.080
She drove herself to death.

40:37.360 --> 40:39.040
I don't want to see

40:39.640 --> 40:40.880
that same pain

40:42.560 --> 40:44.840
in Haode's face.

40:47.040 --> 40:48.800
I can't take it.

40:48.880 --> 40:50.680
Not even for a moment.

41:13.120 --> 41:16.160
Haode, you're determined to divorce?

41:17.680 --> 41:20.840
He's cold, unkind, and careless.

41:20.920 --> 41:21.880
Let them split.

41:22.920 --> 41:26.560
Your brother-in-law said
he knows two eligible men.

41:26.640 --> 41:27.800
Both are still single.

41:29.120 --> 41:32.000
Either way, I won this bet.

41:32.640 --> 41:34.280
Come on. Call me big sis.

41:36.680 --> 41:38.640
- Why hit me?
- For being cheeky.

41:41.120 --> 41:44.480
You were wrong from the start,

41:44.560 --> 41:46.560
putting him on a pedestal.

41:46.640 --> 41:49.600
Men need sweet talks,
but not blind submission.

41:50.200 --> 41:52.760
You let him have his way,
with no care for you.

41:53.360 --> 41:55.160
And now a few fields are all you get?

41:55.240 --> 41:57.000
You didn't marry for money, right?

41:58.760 --> 42:00.840
So, don't settle for this.

42:01.440 --> 42:02.680
Then, what do you want?

42:02.760 --> 42:05.200
Mr. Shen cares for her too.

42:05.720 --> 42:07.040
The temple incident, remember?

42:08.880 --> 42:10.000
Haode, what do you think?

42:12.120 --> 42:15.080
Marriage isn't just a few days.

42:15.160 --> 42:18.280
You work together through it all.
That's a good couple.

42:18.360 --> 42:22.400
He says it's for me,
but it's always his decision.

42:22.480 --> 42:25.280
He treats me like a child,

42:26.120 --> 42:28.520
at his beck and call.

42:29.160 --> 42:30.560
- But I--
- Still can't let go?

42:33.520 --> 42:34.960
She's still young.

42:35.040 --> 42:37.280
Even if she goes back,

42:37.360 --> 42:40.400
she'll just flatter the Shen family,
hoping to keep peace.

42:40.480 --> 42:44.680
Once things are good, he'll change again.

42:45.360 --> 42:48.440
Being submissive is no long-term solution.

42:51.040 --> 42:53.840
So, do you have a plan?

42:54.560 --> 42:58.480
We do have an idea. But you might
be sorry for him to use it.

42:58.560 --> 42:59.720
You won't be able to endure.

43:01.440 --> 43:03.880
Kangning, tell me.

43:05.040 --> 43:08.360
Sweet talks first,

43:08.920 --> 43:10.680
and then taking control by punishments.

43:11.560 --> 43:15.120
You have to punish him hard
for him to remember the lessons.

43:19.600 --> 43:21.400
Fine silks and satin,

43:22.320 --> 43:24.040
bring them over here.

43:25.760 --> 43:28.480
Where are you taking that?
No sense of order?

43:28.560 --> 43:29.440
Put it down.

43:31.680 --> 43:32.560
Young master,

43:33.480 --> 43:36.160
these are the betrothal gifts
sent to the Li family.

43:37.120 --> 43:39.480
This chest holds fine silks.

43:39.560 --> 43:42.000
That one, seasonal flowers.

43:45.160 --> 43:46.480
Jewelry is in that box.

43:46.560 --> 43:49.600
Outside, there's wine and tea cakes.

43:50.120 --> 43:52.240
The Li family returned everything.

43:52.880 --> 43:54.560
The old lady refused to store them.

43:54.640 --> 43:57.520
She insisted on sending them here

43:57.600 --> 44:00.040
for you to handle.

44:10.560 --> 44:12.240
My lord, push.

44:21.000 --> 44:22.080
Come here, hurry.

45:21.720 --> 45:23.880
Are you looking for me?

45:28.200 --> 45:29.480
Aren't you divorcing me?

45:30.840 --> 45:33.840
I was, but my mother said,

45:33.920 --> 45:36.400
money gifted can't be returned.

45:37.400 --> 45:40.840
But she gave you her precious daughter.

45:41.440 --> 45:43.520
She hopes you'll cherish her,
protect her well.

45:44.040 --> 45:46.760
If you lose her again,
you'll regret it forever.

45:46.840 --> 45:49.040
Knowing the surrounding danger,

45:49.640 --> 45:51.760
you still recklessly rush in.

45:52.440 --> 45:54.280
I don't know what to do with you.

45:54.880 --> 45:57.040
People say like attracts like.

45:57.640 --> 45:59.040
You're stubborn.

45:59.120 --> 46:01.200
So am I.

46:01.920 --> 46:04.120
Luckily, it's a perfect match.

46:04.720 --> 46:07.040
But true love is rare.

46:07.760 --> 46:09.400
Now, we're at an impasse.

46:10.040 --> 46:12.640
Let's see who yields first.

46:13.760 --> 46:14.800
Li Haode.

46:17.920 --> 46:20.640
I know what you fear. I swear this to you.

46:21.560 --> 46:24.360
I'll protect myself

46:25.200 --> 46:26.320
and live safely.

46:27.160 --> 46:29.000
But nothing's certain in life.

46:29.080 --> 46:30.720
How can you guarantee

46:31.360 --> 46:33.360
leaving here will bring me happiness?

46:35.000 --> 46:37.880
You've given me lands to remarry.

46:37.960 --> 46:40.800
But how many suitors are sincere?

46:40.880 --> 46:43.040
What if I trust the wrong man?

46:43.960 --> 46:46.360
These money-filled cases today could be

46:46.880 --> 46:48.200
my coffin where I suffocated.

46:48.280 --> 46:49.520
Don't say that.

46:51.800 --> 46:54.120
The safety and peace
even you couldn't grant me.

46:55.920 --> 46:57.280
How can I trust others?

47:00.840 --> 47:02.680
I don't want to force you to be strong

47:04.360 --> 47:06.320
or fear becoming a widow.

47:16.600 --> 47:17.640
I understand.

47:19.200 --> 47:23.440
So, my love for you,
I'll only give you half.

47:24.080 --> 47:27.320
From now on, we'll be respectful,

47:27.400 --> 47:28.640
not intimate.

47:29.760 --> 47:32.400
We'll keep our distance
and greet each other kindly.

47:33.520 --> 47:35.640
I am here to greet you when you come home.

47:35.720 --> 47:37.200
If we divorce again in the future,

47:37.280 --> 47:39.560
I won't be in too much grief.

47:40.520 --> 47:42.360
What if I can't accompany you the end?

47:42.440 --> 47:46.080
If you die before me,
I won't live in mourning,

47:46.720 --> 47:48.520
cold and alone forever.

47:49.080 --> 47:51.480
I won't let you worry about me
even in the afterlife.

47:52.240 --> 47:55.320
I'll mourn three years and then remarry.

47:55.960 --> 47:57.280
Three years is too long.

47:58.240 --> 48:00.920
Then one year.

48:04.480 --> 48:05.320
Three months?

48:09.720 --> 48:10.880
Let's settle there.

48:12.520 --> 48:14.000
Will you let me stay then?

48:15.760 --> 48:16.920
You won't regret it?

48:36.160 --> 48:39.440
The study's a mess.
I'll call someone to clean it.

48:40.240 --> 48:41.880
- But I--
- Qingshi, Qingshi.

48:45.160 --> 48:46.280
Yes, my lady.

48:46.960 --> 48:50.360
Take these boxes away. Don't disturb him.

48:51.000 --> 48:53.480
Right away, my lady.

48:58.600 --> 48:59.760
I haven't eaten yet.

48:59.840 --> 49:02.320
My stomach's empty.

49:02.400 --> 49:03.680
I'll leave you to read.

49:04.280 --> 49:06.800
Enjoy your reading. I'll take my leave.

49:22.120 --> 49:23.480
Quick, quick, come in.

49:23.560 --> 49:25.480
Take all these out.

49:26.040 --> 49:27.520
These ones here. Hurry up.

52:02.280 --> 52:05.480
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
